@startuml command-palette-state
title Command palette lifecycle

[*] --> Closed

Closed --> Open : Cmd+Shift+A\n(open_command_palette)

state Open {
  [*] --> Filtering
  Filtering --> Filtering : query edited\n(filtered_commands)
  Filtering --> Filtering : Up/Down\n(command_palette_move_selection)
}

Open --> Closed : Escape\n(consumes key, top of\nescape-arbitration chain)
Open --> Closed : window close control
Open --> Executing : Enter / row click,\nselected row enabled\n(command_palette_confirm)
Open --> Open : Enter / row click,\nselected row disabled\n(no-op, stays open)

Executing --> Closed : run_command(action)

@enduml
